Package: raiden-gnome-extensions
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @DISTRO_NAME@ <noreply@example.invalid>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 50~), gnome-shell (<< 52~), gir1.2-gmenu-3.0
Description: GNOME Shell extensions used by @DISTRO_NAME@ layouts
 System-wide copies of Dash to Panel (taskbar), ArcMenu (start menu),
 Blur my Shell (glass effects), Caffeine, Desktop Cube and the Magic Lamp
 minimize effect, pinned to versions that support GNOME 50. Their settings
 schemas are installed globally so @DISTRO_NAME@ can provide defaults.
